&lt;h2 id="textbook"&gt;Textbook&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kurose, James F; Ross, Keith W.: &lt;strong&gt;Computer Networking. A Top-Down Approach&lt;/strong&gt;, 8th ed., Pearson Global Editions, Harlow UK, 2021.
ISBN: 978-1-292-40546-9&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The class is based on Jim Kurose&amp;rsquo;s Textbook &amp;ldquo;Computer Networking. A Top-Down Approach&amp;rdquo;.
The textbook has an &lt;a href="https://gaia.cs.umass.edu/kurose_ross/index.php"&gt;accompanying website with a lot of resources&lt;/a&gt;,
especially &lt;a href="https://gaia.cs.umass.edu/kurose_ross/lectures.php"&gt;lecture videos&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can aquire a printed copy or read the book online using licences aquired
through our library - just &lt;a href="https://elibrary.pearson.de/book/99.150005/9781292405513"&gt;access the publisher&amp;rsquo;s book site&lt;/a&gt; from within the HTW
Network (from home, use the &lt;a href="(https://rz.htw-berlin.de/anleitungen/vpn/)"&gt;VPN&lt;/a&gt; and make sure not to use split access)&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>B9 Networks SoSe 2022 - Schedule</title><link>https://bkleinen.github.io/classes/ss2022/networks/schedule/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bkleinen.github.io/classes/ss2022/networks/schedule/</guid><description>&lt;div class="alert alert-danger" role="alert"&gt;
 
